Package: nsonline
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 | libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37, libayatana-appindicator3-1 | libappindicator3-1, libnotify4
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/dorydev/NSOnline
Description: Nintendo Switch Online presence to Discord Rich Presence
 NSOnline mirrors the game a Nintendo Switch Online friend is playing to
 Discord Rich Presence. Desktop app (Flutter) with a bundled local backend.
 Not affiliated with or endorsed by Nintendo. Licence: AGPL-3.0-or-later.
